Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres
Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Ink 2 : Bar 0,0 To 15,15 : Get Sprite 1,0,0 To 16,16
Ink 3 : Circle 8,8,7 : Get Sprite 2,0,0 To 16,16
Sprite 0,X Hard(10),Y Hard(10),1
Sprite 2,200,100,2 : Wait Vbl : Wait Vbl
Print #1,X Sprite(0);Y Sprite(0);I Sprite(0);X Sprite(2);Y Sprite(2);I Sprite(2)
Sprite 8,250,120,1 : Sprite Update : Wait Vbl : Wait Vbl
Print #1,X Sprite(8);Y Sprite(8)
Print #1,X Hard(0);Y Hard(0);X Screen(X Hard(30));Y Screen(Y Hard(40))
Sprite Off 2 : Wait Vbl : Print #1,X Sprite(2)
Sprite Off : Print #1,X Sprite(0)
Set Sprite Buffer 64
Hide : Show : Change Mouse 2 : Print #1,X Mouse>=0;Y Mouse>=0
Paste Bob 100,100,1 : Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/sprites_1.iff"
